        e.printStackTrace();
    }
}
```

3) Root Cause:
The root cause is the absence of explicit cache invalidation in the catch block when an exception occurs. If an exception is thrown, the cache may still hold previous or invalid data for the given key, leading to inconsistencies and potential misuse of cache data.

