1) Vulnerability Description:
The code performs a subtraction operation that causes an integer underflow. Specifically, subtracting 1 from Integer.MIN_VALUE results in wraparound to Integer.MAX_VALUE, leading to unexpected behavior or incorrect program logic. This type of vulnerability is classified under CWE-191: Integer Underflow (Wrap or Wraparound).

2) Vulnerable Code:
