The program assigns the value `Integer.MIN_VALUE` to the variable `index`. When subtracting 1 (`index - 1`), integer underflow occurs, wrapping around to `Integer.MAX_VALUE`. Attempting to access `array[Integer.MAX_VALUE]` causes an `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` because the index exceeds the array bounds.

