The code exposes sensitive data—specifically, a Social Security Number—within an exception's stack trace during the serialization process. When an IOException occurs, the full exception details—including the sensitive information—are printed to the console or logs. This can lead to unintended disclosure of confidential user data, violating privacy and security standards.

2) Vulnerable Code
```java
