      // proceed with safeScore
  } else {
      // handle overflow scenario
      System.out.println("Score exceeds byte range");
  }
  ```
- Use data types that accommodate the full range of data when possible.
- Avoid unvalidated casts between numeric types with different ranges.
- Implement proper input validation and error handling for user-provided data.

This approach prevents numeric truncation errors and ensures data integrity throughout the application.

