1. Vulnerability Description
The provided form bean does not integrate with the Struts validation framework, as it does not extend the required validation class. This omission can lead to inadequate validation handling, potentially allowing malicious or malformed data to bypass validation checks, increasing the risk of security issues such as injection attacks or data corruption.

2. Vulnerable Code
