Vulnerability Report

1. Vulnerability Description
This code snippet demonstrates a scheduled task that throws an unhandled runtime exception. When the exception occurs within the scheduled thread, it is not caught or managed, potentially leading to application instability or unexpected behavior. Such uncaught exceptions in multithreaded environments can cause thread termination and affect overall system robustness.

2. Vulnerable Code
```java
