1. Vulnerability Description
The code demonstrates a risk associated with unvalidated action forms in a Struts application. It directly accesses form data without proper validation or sanitization, which can lead to security issues such as improper input handling or manipulation.

2. Vulnerable Code
```java
public class RegistrationAction extends Action {
